  m_Name: Lesson 5 Question 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: What right does God have over creation as the Maker of all?
  answers:
  - The right to watch TV all day
  - The right to rule over all
  - The right to eat all day
  - The right to sleep all day
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: God made everything that exists, so it all belongs to Him.  God
    is the Lord, the ruler, of all creation.
